    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2>Christmas Eve 202X, somewhere in the USA. The homeless Protagonist Richard\u00a0stamps through the snow to find a shelter to protect him from the cold. Luckily he finds an abandoned house where he can rest. Later that night he awakes from a strange sound coming from the fireplace. To his surprise a pretty woman in a seductive Santa Dress crawled down the chimney, claiming that the house belonged to her. <br>What will Richard do?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289010/extras/3f689344152b40d370d7fae75db0eae8.avif?t=1740770141\" width=616 height=231 /></span><br>Name: Richard Charles Gein-Bundy<br>Age: 22<br>Height: 183 cm<br>Weight: 59 kg<br>Richard grew up in poverty at his dad's trailer. As a teenager, he ran away and started to live on the street. He is a loner and prefers to survive independently instead of relying on others.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289010/extras/91ba17d7d463ca778f6cb981b6fe917c.avif?t=1740770141\" width=616 height=231 /></span><br>Name: Joanne Aileen Cotton<br>Age: 21<br>Height: 166 cm<br>Weight: 50 kg<br>Joanne inherit the house of her beloved late grandmother but had to leave for a long time to stay in a hospital for treatment. She is cheerful but sometimes seems to be in her own little world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2>-Different Endings<br>-Original handmade Anime Art, NO AI is used<br>-Achievements<br>-CG Gallery<br>-very short<br>-Supports Windows and Linux",
